# Prompt
```ts
export function getRelativePath(fileOrFolderFullPath : string, basePath : string) : string;
```
Algorithm:
* If fileOrFolderFullPath is a subpath of basePath, compute its relative path
according to basePath.
Example:
getRelativePath("/usr/some/path/to/file.txt","/usr/some/path") -> "to/file.txt"
getRelativePath("/usr/some/path/to/folder","/usr/some/path") -> "to/folder"
* If fileOrFolderFullPath is not a subpath of basePath, just return
fileOrFolderFullPath